# A1/A1.2/A1_19_housing_and_home.letz
# Source: PDF slide deck "L10 a1convlotsmanmeli.pdf" (A1 Conversation course, Lesson 10)
# (m)/(f)/(n) gender markers stripped; plural nouns taught only where a sentence
# actually uses them; verb conjugation tables reduced to the infinitive.
# Fills added: 18 @fill blocks drilling adjective inflection in dative (masculine/
# neuter -en vs. feminine -er — competing endings as distractors), gendered inanimate
# pronouns (en/se/et chosen by noun gender), prepositions (an/zu/vun/no bei),
# connectors (mä/mee/well), and ordinals (éischte/zweete). Sentences added from
# Part 2 descriptive passages (house listing, neighbourhood description).

@lesson A1.19 "Housing & Home"

# --- Quantifiers & degree ---
@word wéineg = few
@word souguer = even
@word leider = unfortunately
@word wierklech = really
@word ganz = very
@word immens = extremely
@word relativ = rather
@word sou = so
@word e bësse = a bit

# --- Distance & location ---
@word ze = too
@word no = close
@word no bei der Stad = close to the city
@word baussen = outside
@word bannen = inside

# --- Descriptive adjectives ---
@word interessant = interesting
@word sympathesch = likeable
@word kannerfrëndlech = child-friendly
@word fein = nice
@word aneres = other, else

# --- Ordinals ---
@word éischt = first
@word zweet = second

# --- Connectors ---
@word well = because

# --- Verbs ---
@word mathuelen = to take, to take away
@word leien = to lie down
@word léien = to lie, to tell untruths
@word ze verlounen = for rent
@word ze verkafen = for sale

# --- Housing types ---
@word d'Wunnengssich = the house-hunt

# --- Rooms & features ---
@word d'Toilett = the toilet
@word de Lift = the elevator
@word de Stack = the floor

# --- Life & surroundings ---
@word d'Liewen = the life
@word d'Virdeeler = the advantages
@word d'Nodeeler = the disadvantages
@word den Noper = the neighbour
@word de Lëtzebuerger = the Luxembourger
@word d'Spillplaz = the playground
@word den Honger = the hunger
@word de Summer = the summer

@sentence
@lu Du hues Recht.
@en You are right.
@distractor-lu roueg
@distractor-lu grouss
@distractor-en quiet
@distractor-en big

@sentence
@lu Wunns du an engem Duerf oder an der Stad?
@en Do you live in a village or in the city?
